(DRILLING EVENT: MUD LOSS at 2420m \(Severity: HIGH\)) Tj
T*
(Description: Severe mud loss observed in Kopili Formation. Rate: 12 m3/hr into fractured zone.) Tj
T*
(Cause: Natural micro-fractures in upper Kopili carbonate stringer coupled with excessive ECD during surge.) Tj
T*
(Mitigation: Reduced flow rate from 2400 to 1800 L/min. Spotted coarse and medium nutshell LCM pill \(50 bbl\).) Tj
T*
(Outcome: Full returns established after 2.0 hours. Resumed drilling with managed equivalent circulating density.) Tj
T*
(NPT Hours: 2.0 | Mud Loss Rate: 12 m3/hr) Tj
